<view class="vip-page">
  <text class="vip-title">开通会员</text>
  <text class="vip-sub">基础VIP和高级VIP通过官方小程序虚拟支付开通；高级VIP同时包含1年督学服务。支付成功后自动发放对应权益。</text>

  <view class="plan-list">
    <view class="plan-card {{sel===index?'selected':''}}" wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="code" bindtap="select" data-i="{{index}}">
      <view class="plan-head">
        <text class="plan-tag">{{item.tag || item.title}}</text>
        <text class="plan-price">{{item.priceLabel}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="plan-name">{{item.title}}</text>
      <view class="plan-benefits">
        <text class="plan-benefit" wx:for="{{item.benefits}}" wx:key="*this">· {{item}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="vip-guide" wx:if="{{currentPlan}}">
    <text class="guide-title">当前选择：{{currentPlan.title}}</text>
    <text class="guide-text">支付成功后将自动发放对应权益，并同步更新会员状态与到期时间。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="bottom-action">
    <button class="btn btn-full vip-buy-btn" bindtap="buyVip">立即开通VIP</button>
  </view>
</view>
